---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="页面未找到 · Docling" description="你访问的页面不存在。">
  <main
    id="main-content"
    class="flex min-h-[100dvh] flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 text-center"
  >
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 md:text-4xl">
      页面未找到
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[40ch] text-zinc-400">
      你访问的地址不存在或已移动。返回首页继续浏览 Docling 中文站点。
    </p>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="mt-8 rounded-full bg-accent-strong px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-px active:translate-y-0"
    >
      返回首页
    </a>
  </main>
</Layout>
